# A fact is replaced, and the replaced one is still there.
#
# The seed problem: someone says "I live in Lisbon" in March and "I moved to
# Berlin" in August. A vector index holds both and lets the model choose. Here
# the choice is made by a stated rule, and the losing layer stays readable.

trust policy above user above rumor

alice.city is "Lisbon" as user from onboarding_form on 2026-03-01
alice.city is "Berlin" as user from relocation_ticket on 2026-08-15

show "Where does Alice live?"
what is alice.city
expect what is alice.city is "Berlin"

show ""
show "Where did she live in April, before the move?"
what was alice.city on 2026-04-01
expect what was alice.city on 2026-04-01 is "Lisbon"

show ""
show "Both layers, and why Lisbon is no longer the answer:"
why alice.city
